# Investor Arena policy (Megamind)

## North star
Build the **most profitable** research system. Arena sim is fast feedback; forward paper is the scoreboard.

## Frozen baselines (v1, v2)
- **Never** delete, respawn, or rewrite genomes/ledgers.
- **Do** daily pulse + dated snapshots under `data/trader_arena/snapshots/`.

## Operating model (v3+)
- **Champion** (v3): evolve in place via `harvest.py` + `real_agents.py` (cross-pool learnings).
- **Challenger**: at most one extra arm when testing a **new feed**; replace/archive old challenger.
- **Archived** forks (v4+): harvest-only — do not pulse or respawn.
- **Pulse** `--version active` only (v1, v2, champion, challenger).
- Megamind **update** champion by default; **spawn** only for new-feed hypotheses (`decision.py`).

## APIs
- `GET /api/arena/operating` — champion/challenger/pulse list
- `GET /api/real-agents` — predictor + policy registry (≤5 agents)
